This repository is ScamCheck. This rule is a pointer, not the instruction set; the rules are written once, in their owning files, and are never copied here.

1. Read `WHAT-THIS-IS.md`, the charter. It governs everything.
2. Read `AGENTS.md`, your entry point, and follow it.
3. Screening a message → `screen/AGENTS.md` plus `screen/00-principles.md` and `screen/01-screen/screen.md`.
4. Never fetch, click, or transmit anything. Never commit anything from any `my-files/` directory.
